# HVAS app build config. Copy to `.env` (or set in CI) before `npm run build`.
#
# Point the app at your deployed HVAS backend to turn on real member sessions
# and the in-venue social layer (presence, chat, linking). Leave it UNSET to
# build the fully-local demo (local auth, solo game) — the default.
#
# VITE_HVAS_API=https://hvas-backend.fly.dev

# ── PayPal Subscriptions (real recurring billing to YOUR PayPal) ──
# 1. Create a REST app at developer.paypal.com → copy its Client ID (live).
# 2. Create one subscription PLAN per tier (see PAYPAL_SETUP.md) → paste the
#    plan ids (P-XXXXXXXX) below. Any tier left blank stays on the demo button.
# VITE_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=your_live_client_id
# VITE_PAYPAL_PLAN_DAILY=P-...
# VITE_PAYPAL_PLAN_WEEKLY=P-...
# VITE_PAYPAL_PLAN_MONTHLY=P-...
# VITE_PAYPAL_PLAN_YEARLY=P-...
# VITE_PAYPAL_PLAN_VIP=P-...

# ── HVAS Pay (rail-agnostic settlement) ──
# Your Navy Federal Zelle handle (email or phone) so members can Zelle you.
# Cash and Zelle claims are confirmed by staff on the Payments screen.
# VITE_ZELLE_HANDLE=you@email.com
